# Vite's dep optimizer emits bare imports for transitive dependencies (e.g.
# `@sentry/core` from inside the prebundled `@sentry/react`), which pnpm's
# isolated node_modules cannot resolve from the app directory. Public hoisting
# puts them in the root node_modules so those imports resolve, and it also
# satisfies Electron Forge, which refuses to run under pnpm without a declared
# hoisting strategy.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*
